#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_co_dian_invoice_synchronizer/models/dian_api_client.py:0
msgid ""
"DIAN answered the document query (page %(page)d) with something that is not "
"the expected data (content type: %(type)s, %(size)s characters). The DIAN "
"session may have expired, or DIAN changed the service. Generate a new token "
"and try again; if it persists, check the server log."
msgstr ""
"La DIAN respondió la consulta de documentos (página %(page)d) con algo que "
"no son los datos esperados (tipo de contenido: %(type)s, %(size)s "
"caracteres). Puede que la sesión DIAN haya expirado o que la DIAN haya "
"cambiado el servicio. Genere un token nuevo e intente de nuevo; si persiste,"
" revise el log del servidor."

#. module: l10n_co_dian_invoice_synchronizer
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_co_dian_invoice_synchronizer.field_dian_document__type_code
msgid ""
"DIAN document type code (DocumentTypeId), e.g. 01 invoice, 91 credit note, "
"92 debit note."
msgstr ""
"Código del tipo de documento en la DIAN (DocumentTypeId), p. ej. 01 factura,"
" 91 nota crédito, 92 nota débito."

#. module: l10n_co_dian_invoice_synchronizer
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_co_dian_invoice_synchronizer/models/dian_api_client.py:0
msgid ""
"DIAN redirected the document query (page %(page)d) to %(location)s instead "
"of answering it. The DIAN session is not valid or expired: generate a new "
"token and try again."
msgstr ""
"La DIAN redirigió la consulta de documentos (página %(page)d) a %(location)s"
" en lugar de responderla. La sesión DIAN no es válida o expiró: genere un "
"token nuevo e intente de nuevo."

